   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MDLF Management - Media Training Centre</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MDLF Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MDLF aims at continuing its training of key media persons in management and business; but also at introducing a new project for Internet publishing, regional exchange of news articles and income generating for certain Serbian media.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MDLF vill med detta projekt dels forts&#xE4;tta sin utbildning i  management f&#xF6;r nyckelpersoner inom viktiga medier p&#xE5; Balkan; dels introducera ett projekt f&#xF6;r Internetpublicering, regionalt utbyte av produktion samt inkomstgenerering f&#xF6;r lokala medier i Serbien.</narrative>
  </description>
